\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces  The proposed ForesightNav framework. The perception system processes local perceptual observations together with the UAV state to form dynamic-obstacle, static-geometry proximity, and navigation representations. Modality-specific MLP and CNN encoders transform these inputs into a shared embedding for the predictive actor--critic. During training, the TTC-aware 3D-VO risk reward and action-conditioned multi-horizon outcome predictor jointly shape policy learning in parallel curriculum environments. During deployment, the outcome predictor is removed, and the Beta-policy actor directly generates velocity actions that can be further refined by an optional safety shield.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig_zong}{{1}{2}{}{figure.1}{}}
